# MP-09 - Cart persistence during navigation and logout behavior

## Priority
Medium

## Type
Edge

## Steps

1. Login with valid credentials.
2. Add two products to cart.
3. Navigate away from the site to another URL in the same tab and then return to SauceDemo.
4. Open the cart and verify contents.
5. Log out of the application (if logout available) and log back in with same credentials.
6. Open the cart again.

## Expected Result

Cart contents persist during navigation within the same session and are visible when returning. After logout and re-login, behavior is defined (either cart persists across sessions or is cleared) — the application should behave consistently with its specification. If the app is designed to clear cart on logout, verify cart is empty and user is informed; if it persists, verify items remain intact.
